          <span class="tw:mt-[7px] tw:h-[7px] tw:w-[7px] tw:shrink-0 tw:rounded-full tw:bg-[#3b82f6]"></span>
          <div><p class="tw:text-[15px] tw:font-semibold tw:text-white">Hot folder support</p><p class="tw:text-[14px] tw:leading-[1.5] tw:text-neutral-400">Point tonescan at a folder and new scans are ingested and converted the moment they land.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tw:flex tw:gap-[12px]">
          <span class="tw:mt-[7px] tw:h-[7px] tw:w-[7px] tw:shrink-0 tw:rounded-full tw:bg-[#3b82f6]"></span>
          <div><p class="tw:text-[15px] tw:font-semibold tw:text-white">White-light scan support</p><p class="tw:text-[14px] tw:leading-[1.5] tw:text-neutral-400">Prefer a single-shot light source? Fully supported too.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tw:flex tw:gap-[12px]">
          <span class="tw:mt-[7px] tw:h-[7px] tw:w-[7px] tw:shrink-0 tw:rounded-full tw:bg-[#3b82f6]"></span>
          <div><p class="tw:text-[15px] tw:font-semibold tw:text-white">Smart auto white balance</p><p class="tw:text-[14px] tw:leading-[1.5] tw:text-neutral-400">Neutral, accurate colour without manual picking.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tw:flex tw:gap-[12px]">
          <span class="tw:mt-[7px] tw:h-[7px] tw:w-[7px] tw:shrink-0 tw:rounded-full tw:bg-[#3b82f6]"></span>
          <div><p class="tw:text-[15px] tw:font-semibold tw:text-white">Flat-field correction</p><p class="tw:text-[14px] tw:leading-[1.5] tw:text-neutral-400">Even illumination edge to edge across every frame.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tw:flex tw:gap-[12px]">
          <span class="tw:mt-[7px] tw:h-[7px] tw:w-[7px] tw:shrink-0 tw:rounded-full tw:bg-[#3b82f6]"></span>
          <div><p class="tw:text-[15px] tw:font-semibold tw:text-white">Keyboard-driven</p><p class="tw:text-[14px] tw:leading-[1.5] tw:text-neutral-400">Shortcuts for everything, so you can fly through a roll.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tw:flex tw:gap-[12px]">
          <span class="tw:mt-[7px] tw:h-[7px] tw:w-[7px] tw:shrink-0 tw:rounded-full tw:bg-[#3b82f6]"></span>
          <div><p class="tw:text-[15px] tw:font-semibold tw:text-white">Fully standalone</p><p class="tw:text-[14px] tw:leading-[1.5] tw:text-neutral-400">No Lightroom, no plugins, no host app required.</p></div>
        </div>
        <div class="tw:flex tw:gap-[12px]">
          <span class="tw:mt-[7px] tw:h-[7px] tw:w-[7px] tw:shrink-0 tw:rounded-full tw:bg-[#3b82f6]"></span>
          <div><p class="tw:text-[15px] tw:font-semibold tw:text-white">Flexible licensing</p><p class="tw:text-[14px] tw:leading-[1.5] tw:text-neutral-400">Own it outright or subscribe — your choice.</p></div>
        </div>
